<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Amcorp year net up 59.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Amcorp year net up 59.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 315.52   vs	 197.78</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	185.30   vs	 120.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		   491.90   vs	 372.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   502.66   vs	 321.87</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  6.91   vs  less   5.47</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.59   vs	   2.37</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 6.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Arab-Malaysian Corp Bhd is involved in rubber and palm oil plantations, among other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
